      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know why i'm still logging in. everything is just over. i found a massive error in my primary dataset today and it's not something i can just \"fix\" or \"patch\"... it's fundamentally broken. years of work just gone. i look at my advisor and my lab mates and i just feel like such a fraud. there's no coming back from this. my entire future just evaporated in a second.",
