      "content": "I hear that this situation is deeply affecting you, and your feelings are completely valid. It's important to acknowledge the emotional pain you're going through here. Reaching out for support from mentors, colleagues, professional counselors, or even a crisis hotline can be a great first step. These steps may help manage the overwhelming feelings and provide guidance on how to move forward. Building a life doesn't have to start from scratch; often, it's about creating new pathways. You don't have to do this alone.",
      "source": "target",
